OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava bans: Will they actually
OL,4,Awork?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move follows similar measures in
OL,7,FWolverhampton and comes days after
OL,8,FNottingham became one of the first
OL,9,Fplaces in the UK to introduce
OL,10,Frestrictions on face coverings in
OL,11,Fpublic spaces, with people facing fines
OL,12,For prosecution if they refuse to remove
OL,13,Fthem.
